From b0437efd5b34ff3cbedaca3d762a707f79c19a3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 12:07:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix account balance bugs + edit saldo + custom account picker

- HistorialTab: fix handleUpdateMovimiento to correctly rebalance both
  accounts when cuenta_id changes (reverse old, apply to new account)
- page.tsx: apply same fix to the edit-last-saved path
- CuentasModal: add inline edit-saldo button (pencil icon) per account;
  shows saldo_actual instead of saldo_inicial in subtitle
- EditMovimientoModal: replace native <select> with styled BottomSheet
  for account selection, matching app design language
- i18n: add saldoActual, editSaldo keys to es/en/ca

https://claude.ai/code/session_018sYY9aTnRkxN86F7tx7ANQ
